        "message": "fix: make live Flow F CERT robust to re-renders and quota-blocked runs\n\nJudge the race verdict by rendered card names only (UI chrome text caused\nfalse positives when zero cards render), use DOM-dispatched clicks that\nsurvive card-list re-renders, resolve Windows Chrome/Edge for local\nverification runs, and stamp quotaBlocked in the evidence JSON when\nGoogle rate-limiting blocks discovery. Includes the captured evidence of\na live run blocked by external Google 429s.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>",
